      "content": "Please understand that even if it worked in the past, your kidney function may have changed, making this medication potentially unsafe for you now. Dosing and safety for nitrofurantoin are highly dependent on your specific kidney function, and only a doctor can evaluate that safely. To avoid serious complications, please try calling your doctor's office again and explain that you think you have an infection, as they may have a nurse who can advise you differently.",
      "source": "target",
